        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "一块儿 before an action means together. It describes joint participation, not a piece or a unit of money.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我们一块儿去。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen yīkuàir qù 。",
                "meaning": "We will go together.",
